# Database Migrations

This directory contains database migration files for HealthForecast AI.

## Running Migrations

### Initialize migrations (first time only)
```bash
cd backendflask db init
```

### Create a new migration
```bash
flask db migrate -m "description of changes"
```

### Apply migrations
```bash
flask db upgrade
```

### Rollback migrations
```bash
flask db downgrade
```

## Migration Files

Migrations are automatically generated by Flask-Migrate and should not be manually edited unless necessary.
